nav-bar([showDashboardOptions]="true")
.container-main
  .row
    //- .navy-gradient.has-sparks
    //- .sparks
    .col-6
      .card.card--academy.has-sparks
        .sparks
        .hero-smash__wrap
          img.hero-smash(src="/assets/images/logo-academy.svg")
        h1.center.on-dark Welcome to Hero Academy
    .col-6
        h2 Congratulations!
        p You have joined the #ACADEMY NAME# league of Heroes. As a member of this elite team, you have access to all of the Edji Hero powers.
        p Give some of your new powers a try:
        p
          b Create Questions
          br
          | Create a <a class="link" [routerLink]="['/new-reading']">New Reading</a> to add inline Questions!
        p
          b Comment Replies
          br
          | Try enabling Comment Replies for a new Reading Group on your <a class="link" [routerLink]="['/dashboard']">Dashboard</a>
        p
          b More About Hero
          br 
          | Check out the <a class="link" href="http//guide.edji.it">Edji Guide</a> to find out more about your Hero powers.